# 4. PERMISSION PRINCIPLE

Never rely only on hiding buttons in React.

Frontend:

```text
Hide unauthorized UI
```

AND backend:

```text
Reject unauthorized API requests
```

Example:

```text
Cashier → PUT /api/products/:id
        ↓
403 Forbidden
```

Even if the cashier manually calls the API.

Implement middleware:

```text
authenticate
    ↓
authorize("ADMIN")
```

