# 12. STOCK LEDGER

Do not rely only on a quantity field.

Maintain a stock movement ledger.

Movement types:

```text
OPENING_STOCK
PURCHASE
SALE
SALE_RETURN
PURCHASE_RETURN
ADJUSTMENT
DAMAGE
VOID_REVERSAL
```

Example:

```text
Opening Stock       +50
Purchase            +100
Sale                 -20
Sale Return           +2
Damage                -1
Adjustment            -2
-------------------------
Current Stock        129
```

Every stock movement must record:

```text
productId
stockType
movementType
quantity
previousStock
newStock
referenceType
referenceId
reason
createdBy
createdAt
```

