# 14. PURCHASE RECEIVING

Purchase lifecycle:

```text
DRAFT
   ↓
PENDING
   ↓
RECEIVED
   ↓
COMPLETED
```

Inventory must increase ONLY when the purchase is received/completed.

When received:

```text
Purchase
   ↓
Purchase Service
   ↓
Stock Service
   ↓
Stock Movement
   ↓
Inventory Updated
```

Example:

```text
Before:
TP Kingfisher = 50

Purchase:
+100

After:
TP Kingfisher = 150
```

The update must happen immediately.

Use MongoDB transactions where appropriate to prevent inconsistent inventory.

