# 24. BILL VOID / CANCELLATION

Do NOT physically delete completed bills.

Use:

```text
ACTIVE
VOIDED
```

When an Admin voids a bill:

```text
Sale
 ↓
Void
 ↓
Reverse stock movement
 ↓
Restore inventory
 ↓
Audit log
```

Example:

```text
Original sale:
TP -5

Void:
TP +5
```

Cashiers should NOT be able to void completed bills unless explicitly enabled by an Admin-configurable permission.

